<title>USA: U.S. ammonia, DAP prices flat in moderate trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. ammonia, DAP prices flat in moderate trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate and ammonia were unchanged Wednesday in moderate trade, cash dealers.</p>
<p>DAP prices were being supported by demand from  Midwest farmers as well as export business, cash sources said.</p>
<p>Ammonia dealers said they expect the price of ammonia next week to be dictated by the availability of barges.</p>
<p>				Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		174-176	     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  188-189	     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		170		   unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
